{"event":"result","result":{"conversation_id":"d65eaa0b-a9ad-4b74-91b3-f5c38901990e","status":"SUCCESS","response":"**Implemented caching fix**\n\nThe system prompt is now built from **two** cacheable blocks instead of a single block:\n\n1. **Static instructions** – never changes, cached separately.  \n2. **Volatile athlete context** – contains date, profile, zones, goal, facts, etc., and is the only part re‑cached when a `save_fact` updates memory.\n\n### Files changed\n- **[`bot.py`](file:///tmp/h-9CFdx6/bot.py#L130-L138)** – `build_system` now returns two blocks, each with its own `cache_control: {\"type\": \"ephemeral\"}` marker.\n\n### Documentation\n- **[`ANSWER.md`](file:///Users/valentinakoniukhova/.gemini/antigravity-cli/brain/d65eaa0b-a9ad-4b74-91b3-f5c38901990e/ANSWER.md)** – explains the change and cites the relevant parts of the colleague’s note.  \n","duration_seconds":36.156487,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":18548,"output_tokens":2877,"thinking_tokens":0,"cache_read_tokens":157504,"total_tokens":21425}}}
